{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Main Storyline</strong>\uff1a<br>Players will take on the role of a warrior of the Red Church, led by the great leader Maxwell, to defeat powerful reactionary enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Size</strong>\uff1a<br>The game includes a total of 6 main levels. Except for the main city level of Lonserf, each level is massive and features traditional Souls-like sandbox levels. The game includes a total of 10 boss battles and over 80 different AI combat encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Voiceover &amp; Subtitles</strong>\uff1a<br>The game includes both Chinese and English voiceovers, with multi-language subtitles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features</strong>\uff1a</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Diverse enemy attack moves<br>Basic combo attacks, dangerous strikes, fatal attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333250/extras/\u653b\u51fb\u5c55\u793a6-1.gif?t=1749369202\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multi-layered enemy counter mechanisms and rewards<br>Mikiri counter, dodge, parry, gun counter, riposte</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333250/extras/\u653b\u51fb\u5c55\u793a3-1.gif?t=1749369202\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An epic and stirring historical adventure storyline<br>Multiple church factions compete for the right to lead Gurettvo, involving conspiracies, grudges, grand historical trends, and the victory of ideals and beliefs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333250/extras/\u5267\u60c5\u5c55\u793a-1.gif?t=1749369202\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Various items, skills, and martial arts to &quot;abuse&quot; bosse